{"id":"19.01.Lego","contentHtml":"<p>As <strong>Lead Developer</strong> on this major educational project, I was responsible for creating the <strong>key technical system</strong> - the interactive 3D assembler.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The main task was to create a <strong>scalable platform</strong> for interactive 3D assembly instructions for <strong>over 70 unique Lego models</strong>, capable of handling hundreds of parts and assembly steps.</p>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Scalable Architecture:</strong> Designed a modular system that easily processed data about any of the 70+ models, automatically building the assembly sequence.</li>\n<li><strong>Fault-Tolerant Animation System:</strong> A key feature was the <strong>cascade animation system</strong>, designed to withstand chaotic input (rapid clicks). <mark>Animations did not break or intersect</mark>, ensuring a flawless UX.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Outcome</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Flexible Platform Created:</strong> Successfully developed a system that became the foundation for a <strong>huge educational product with 70+ models</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>High UX Ensured:</strong> The fault-tolerant animation system provided a smooth and intuitive experience for children and educators.</li>\n<li><strong>Demonstration of Lead Skills:</strong> The project proves the ability to <mark>design and implement complex, scalable, and fault-tolerant architectures</mark> for large products.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Interactive Manual \"Ikarionok\" (Lego WeDo 2.0)","date":"2019-01","type":"project","tagsArray":["PC","Web","Unity","C#","DOTween"],"heroVideo":["Xb3h9HkqqUw","O00hrPbnc-s"],"shortDescription":"<p>As <strong>Lead Developer</strong>, designed a <mark>scalable platform</mark> for the 3D assembly of 70+ models featuring a fault-tolerant animation system.</p>\n","role":"lead","storeLinks":["https://labstand.ru/catalog/prezentaczii-i-plakaty-komplekty-dlya-nachalnoj-shkoly/interaktivnoe-posobie-ikaryonok-na-baze-lego-wedo-2-0-dlya-detej-6-7-let","https://labstand.ru/catalog/prezentaczii-i-plakaty-komplekty-dlya-nachalnoj-shkoly/interaktivnoe-posobie-ikaryonok-na-baze-lego-robokids-dlya-detej-5-6-let"],"projectIcon":"/images/projects/19.01.Lego/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/19.01.Lego/card.video?v=1765111501005&webm=1&mp4=1","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/19.01.Lego/screenshots/1.webp","width":1150,"height":720},{"src":"/images/projects/19.01.Lego/screenshots/2.webp","width":1150,"height":720}]}